  _pageType: 0
  _text: 'In 2010, at 60, I retired. Anne and I traveled a bit: Italy, Spain, to
    see the world. At home, I read history books and did odd jobs around the house.
    The children often came with the grandchildren, and we had barbecues. It was
    peaceful, just as I had always imagined.'
